"Eden, the Switch emulator, by the Eden team; ProsperoEden, its PS5 port and launcher, by Sword, BlackBearReloaded, bawsdeep, Rockiu0 and its contributors.\n"
"Box art and game information: GameTDB. The font: Lexend. The remote touch screen: dolphin78's idea and prototype.\n"
"An unofficial port, not affiliated with the Cemu, Azahar, melonDS or Eden teams, Nintendo or Sony.\n"
"\n"
